  "scope": "Whole product checkpoint load coordination now lives in the adapter over unchanged core staging and finalization. The original native owner retains same-transaction bounded reads, record/dispatch/graph/audit proofs, allocator repair and atomic commit. No recovered maps leave the coordinator before commit and owner cleanup.",
